# Fix Prompt for Scenario calc-001-double: Double a number

## Resolved suite

The architectural spec (`docs/architecture/architecture.yaml`) declares
one service, `name: calc`. The suite that owns it is the tree
`tests/calc/`, so the only writable tree for this fix is:

    tests/calc/steps/

Do not create a new file. The suite's step package already exists and
